## DependsOn: LibAddonMenu-2.0>=41
## Description: Warns when Huntsman Warmask is equipped but bash-applied buff/debuff is missing in combat. Features customizable timer, warning display, and line-to-target visual aid. Usage: /hwr. Credits: Scene management by Duesentrieb. Line drawing based on BetterGuard by TheMrPancake, CrutchAlerts by Kyzeragon, and OdySupportIcons by Lamierina7.

HuntsmanWarmaskReminder.lua
HWRMenu.lua
HWRLine.lua

## Changelog:
## v1.2.1 - New features: Line-to-target visual aid (PvE only), horizontal layout option, bashed target name display, "can bash" text indicator, font family selection, bashed target font size setting. Code quality: Fixed duplicate code bug, added proper local declarations, improved operator precedence, removed unused code, consolidated constants, moved scene callbacks into Initialize().

